**What this pass actually was.** The draft entered clean on the usual de-AI metrics (0 em-dashes, 0 strong contrast pairs, 0 lint fails), so almost none of the work was prose cleanup. The jury's finding was evidence handling: a piece that trains readers to expect outlet-and-date rigor, then breaks that contract in specific places. That's what I fixed.

**The seven P0 repairs:**

